  "Name": "Madagascar Kartz",
  "Overview": "Come On, Let's Move It!\n\n\n\nExperience the zany characters and unique locations of the Madagascar movies in the over the top fun of arcade style racing. Put the pedal to the metal Madagascar style with wacky kartz, wild tracks, unique pick-ups and more! Buckle up, strap in and get your animal instincts in high gear!\n\nFeatures\n\n• YOUR FAVORITE MADAGASCAR CHARACTERS - Including Alex, Marty, Gloria, and Melman, the wacky King Julien and the crafty penguins• KRAZY KART ACTION - High flying jumps, flips, rolls, and stunts. Special reward structure for krazy maneuvers• HEAD-TO-HEAD MULTIPLAYER - Take on up to four of your friends• GRAB THE WHEEL FOR KRAZY KART ACTION - Compatible with the Wii Wheel and most other licensed steering wheels.",
